==Strategy==
Here, [[Talents|Talented]] [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] will be necessary for their speed in order to properly wall off the Doge Dark. Use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to earn money from the opening enemies, then bring out [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] to freeze the Bun Buns when they come out. Finally, deploy an attacker like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to target them while they're being repeatedly frozen.

[[Battle Items#Cat Jobs|Cat Jobs]] will earn more XP for beating this stage, so if you can beat this stage reliably, you can get the most out of your Cat Jobs power ups here. If you're confident in your lineup, you can even bring [[Freshman Cat Jobs (Super Rare Cat)|Freshman Cat Jobs]] in order to increase the XP gained.

